{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02893","headline":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降三首 三 · 胡元范","name":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"列席诏亲贤，式宴坐神仙。\n圣文飞圣笔，天乐奏钧天。\n曲池涵瑞景，文宇孕祥烟。\n小臣同百兽，率舞悦尧年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡元范","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}